; SweK_Engine fbxAnimIngest-selfcheck fixture -- hand-authored, original content, ASCII FBX 7.4.
; Not derived from any third-party asset -- written for this repository, zero licensing question.
; Task #59 (the deferred follow-up to task #44). Minimal rigged + animated rig: 2 bones (root at
; the origin, child offset (0,1,0)), the same quad mesh gpu/fixtures/fbxIngest.ascii.fbx uses, skinned
; to them (bottom 2 control points -> root, top 2 -> child, full weight each, no blending), and one
; animation clip ("TestClip") with a single QuaternionKeyframeTrack rotating the child bone 0 -> 90
; degrees about X over 1 second (2 keyframes). See gpu/fixtures/PROVENANCE.md's entry for this file
; and gpu/fbxLoad.js's header for exactly what this exercises.

